DevSpace Host Control

An independent host-control extension developed from the architecture study of
DevSpace (https://github.com/loft-sh/devspace), fixed research base:
8ff6260787edacfa2c0d30d1ff62358d36d482bc.

This repository publishes the new HostControl module and its companion skill.
It does not contain the full upstream Kubernetes project and is not an official
DevSpace or Anthropic product. Upstream and project licensing: Apache-2.0.
The preserved upstream license is also included in the skill assets.
